# Cloud run scratch: source bundles are copies of versioned files; archives and pulled tarballs are large
WorkingMemory/PlainBaseline/runs/*/bundle/
WorkingMemory/PlainBaseline/runs/*/bundle.tar.gz
WorkingMemory/PlainBaseline/runs/*/*.tar.gz
WorkingMemory/PlainBaseline/runs/*/known_hosts
