# Local tool state and generated platform/browser dependencies.
.DS_Store
.flash/
**/.deps/
**/.qa-chrome/
**/sensory_swift_cache/
**/.test-tmp*/
# Worker stdout duplicates the structured progress/result files retained in Git.
**/*.stdout.log
